~ start
???: We meet again, old friend.
You: You? Why are you here? 
???: That's no way to greet me.
You: I told you before,
  I'm not supposed to spend time with you.
$> start_tripping()
Death: Yet you invited me in.
	Right inside of you...
You: No.
	You are just trying to get into my head.
Death: I'm already in your stomach,
	your blood, and your head.
You: Those shrooms were fine...
Death: They were fine 6 months ago.
	You'd never eat bread that blue.
You: I've had worse...
Death: And each time I've missed you
	by just that much,
Death: but now you're luck has run out.
$> start_music()
Death: ...
Death: You feel it, don't you?
Death: The End?
You?: This...
	this is just ego death.
Death: ...
Death: Since you've been good company,
	I'll grant one last mercy...
Death: I'll meet you at the peak.
=> END

~ first_collapse
Death: Well, aren't you just a little Schrödinger's cat?
Still You?: Did I die?!
Death: You're on the death spectrum.
Still You: I can still turn this trip around!
Death: You can drink some water.
	You'll want it.
You: That's ominous...
Losing You: ...
	Oh no...
...
	An entire dimension crumbles.
=> END

~ second_collapse
Death: You're almost there.
Death: I know you can feel it now.
Barely You: Can I just start over?
	Everything?
Death: The thing is...
Death: You will...
...
	Another dimension crumbles.
=> END

~ final_collapse
Death: I'm here for you, old friend.
Someone Formerly You: There is no I anymore. 
We are all one.
Death: ...
	We will be soon.
...
	...
	...
	...
You crumble.
=> END
